      "writtenOn": "2022-12-05T20:55:30Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The slight elegance gained by having it as a STATIC_IF structure rather than ifdef-ing out fields primarily.  I\u0027d definitely prefer to not add space to boards which aren\u0027t using the feature, it\u0027s just a matter of the best way to achieve that.",
